师。紧急情况下为抢救垂危患者，可以先行实施必要的紧急救护。发现医嘱违法违规，或者违反诊疗技术规范的，要向医师提出，必要时向科室负责人报告。民法典另有规定：自愿出手做紧急救助，结果把被救的人弄伤了的，救人的一方不用赔钱（不承担民事责任）（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院 (2008). 护士条例（国务院令第 517 号，第十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2008-03/28/content_6169.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2008-03/28/content_6169.htm"]},"；国务院 (2020). 护士条例（2020 年修订，第十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081777d07c50177b8ed29bf3950","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081777d07c50177b8ed29bf3950"]},"（国家法律法规数据库）；全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第一百八十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["岗位之内按规程办，紧急救人受法律保护。其余的事，先分清是谁的权限、谁的责任，别用私人的好意代替制度上的决定。护士条例 2020 年经国务院令第 726 号修订，只改了注册那几条，第十七条一字未动。医师法里关于按诊疗规范执业的条款，本次未能打开官方原文，所以没有引用。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/12-21"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"商品、包装、吊牌和宣传图上的图案要么自己做要么买授权，改个颜色、加个图标不算「改过了」"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/12-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"亏了就按程序退场：能简易注销就注销，资不抵债走破产，别放着不管"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["工资按合同和法律给，加薪、借款、奖金都走书面"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["工资要按合同和法律按时足额发。欠了，员工可以直接找法院开支付令。加薪、奖金、垫付只是口头说说，真吵起来，拿不出证据的一方吃亏。自己掏钱借给员工，要写书面借条，写…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["先卖再造：用预售和小订单验证有人买，再投钱生产"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["有人跟踪了 116 家意大利新公司大约一年：先立一个假设、再拿市场反馈去验的创业者，生意做得更好，也更愿意及时换方向，而且并没有更早放弃。所以，没人肯预付、没人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["样品做出来先过一遍量产清单，再谈开工"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一件样品和一千件的差别，在于钱压在哪里。良率决定真实成本。起订量和账期决定你要先垫多少钱。库存决定钱什么时候能回来。产品要是在强制性认证目录里，没认证、没标认证…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["进货一批留一批票据和上家信息，进货价明显低于市场价的不进：员工进的假货，老板是被判的那个"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["卖假货，挣到 3 万，或者卖到 5 万，就够判刑，判 3 年以下。货压在仓库没卖出去也算。「我不知道是假的」不由你说了算：进货价明显低于市场价又说不出理由，就会…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["花钱请人代运营网店、上开店培训、做「无货源」之前，先问清后面还要不要加钱、销量从哪来"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这类骗局先收一笔小钱，再拿「升级套餐」、垫付货款、解冻金让你一次次加钱。后台的订单和收益可能是做出来的，想提现时就提不出来。靠刷单冲销量本身就违法，被查到的代运…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["开公司、当个体户的，每年 1 月 1 日到 6 月 30 日上网报上一年的年报，没生意也要报，年报不收费"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["开公司、当个体户的，每年上半年要上网报一次上一年的年报。不报就进经营异常名录，补报以后能申请移出。年报不收费。打电话说你漏报、让你去小程序或公众号交钱代办的是骗…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/12"},"children":["阅读整个主题：创业与做生意：别把家底赔进去 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[